      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>רבנים למען זכויות האדם־צפון אמריקה, ימים נוראים תשס”ח (5768/2008)‏</tei:p>
        <tei:p>This liturgy is based on the traditional public confession of sins on Yom Kippur and is meant to complement the existing <tei:hi rend="italic">al ḥet</tei:hi> found in the maḥzor. This prayer written by Rabbi Ed Feld in 2007 for Yom Kippur 5768 was first published at the website of RHR-NA (now T’ruah).</tei:p>
